  "summary": "The studies [V0003, V0001, V0002, V0004, V0007] directly apply graph neural networks to sepsis prediction. Chen et al. (2020) [V0003] use message passing over relational graphs and report an accuracy of 0.74 on LedgerGuard. Adebayo et al. (2018) [V0001] achieve an AUROC of 0.6 on Atlas-ICU using a similar approach. Brennan et al. (2019) [V0002] report a test F1 of 0.67 on AgriSat-4. Duarte et al. (2021) [V0004] report an MAE of 0.81 on CellLife. Duarte et al. (2021) [V0007] use self-attention encoder models and report an MAE of 0.85 on LedgerGuard.",
